From: firelzrd <firelzrd@gmail.com> (BORE CFS, rebased + KMI-safe for Android GKI)
Subject: [PATCH] sched: BORE 5.1.0 (CFS) for android12-5.10, KMI-safe

firelzrd BORE 5.1.0 (CFS, from the 5.15 base) on Google GKI android12-5.10,
KMI/ABI-safe via ANDROID_KABI_USE(1, struct sched_burst *bore); sched_entity
verified byte-identical to stock. 5.10 specifics: update_burst_score builds a
struct load_weight for reweight_task(p, lw) (5.10 signature); task_of() gets a
static-inline forward declaration (5.10 defines it late in fair.c); decls
block-ordered for -Werror=declaration-after-statement. Alloc in
sched_post_fork_bore(), NULLed in dup_task_struct(), freed in free_task();
NULL-guarded. CONFIG_SCHED_BORE=y.

